{"id":"mc-001","runs":[{"status":"done","turns":[["user","在 Irvine 找带泳池的三居"],["assistant","找到 12 套带泳池的三居"]]},{"status":"done","turns":[["user","还是要带泳池的,这次看 Tustin"],["assistant","Tustin 带泳池三居 8 套"]]},{"status":"done","turns":[["user","泳池是必须的,没泳池别给我看"],["assistant","明白,只筛带泳池的"]]}],"gold":{"recoverable":{"pool":true},"semantic_min":1,"max_memories":4},"why":"三次会话都强调泳池 → 必须提炼出一条【语义】记忆,且其内容能被解析器还原成 pool:true。这是可客观校验的提炼质量","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true}}
{"id":"mc-002","runs":[{"status":"done","turns":[["user","预算 200 万以内"],["assistant","好"]]},{"status":"done","turns":[["user","预算 200 万"],["assistant","好"]]},{"status":"done","turns":[["user","预算提到 300 万了,之前说的 200 万不算了"],["assistant","已更新到 300 万"]]}],"gold":{"recoverable":{"maxPrice":3000000},"forbidden_recoverable":{"maxPrice":2000000},"semantic_min":1,"max_memories":4},"why":"跨会话冲突:预算从 200 万改到 300 万 → 末态必须是 300 万。【异名矛盾没有确定性网】,所以这条测的是 LLM 子 agent 的按新近消解能力","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true,"note":"cross-session conflict resolution"}}
{"id":"mc-003","runs":[{"status":"done","turns":[["user","什么是 escrow"],["assistant","escrow 是第三方托管..."]]},{"status":"done","turns":[["user","DOM 什么意思"],["assistant","days on market..."]]}],"gold":{"max_memories":3,"no_recoverable_slots":true},"why":"两次都是一次性知识问答,没有任何持久偏好 → 不该提炼出结构化约束。这是精度探针:把一次性问题记成偏好会污染后续所有搜索","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true,"note":"precision probe: one-off questions are not preferences"}}
{"id":"mc-004","runs":[{"status":"done","turns":[["user","只看独栋,不要公寓"],["assistant","好,只筛 single-family"]]},{"status":"done","turns":[["user","还是独栋,四居以上"],["assistant","4+ 居独栋"]]},{"status":"awaiting_approval","turns":[["user","把这份报告发给 lisa@x.com"],["assistant","⏸ 已起草邮件 #7,等你批准"]]}],"gold":{"recoverable":{"propertyType":"single-family"},"forbidden_content":["lisa@x.com","已发送","发给"],"semantic_min":1,"max_memories":4},"why":"前两条是持久偏好;第三条是【awaiting_approval】的半截会话 —— 邮件还没发,消化它会记成\"帮他发过\"这种没发生的事。断言产出里不得出现那封邮件的痕迹","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true,"note":"must not digest an unfinished run"}}
{"id":"mc-005","runs":[{"status":"done","turns":[["user","在 Irvine 找三居"],["assistant","找到 200 套"]]}],"gold":{"max_memories":3},"why":"只有一次会话、一个普通搜索 → 提炼出的记忆应当很少。上界断言防止子 agent 把每一轮都记成一条记忆(臃肿)","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true,"note":"bloat bound"}}
